# Four-hourly agent-usage reading -> a monthly usage ledger,
# and one `meter` cost row per provider per window in the sd database (sd:234).
# The pack's interpreter, not Homebrew's: it is the one with `sd_db` installed,
# the same build the dashboard serves under (RUNTIME_PYTHON_DEFAULT in
# local-project-dashboard/dashboard.sh). Under any other python3 the script
# still appends the JSONL line and records the missing import as an error.
JOB_SCHEDULE="0 */4 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="\"${SD_PACK_ROOT:-$HOME/repos/platypeeps/sd-ai-command-pack}/.venv/bin/python\" \"$ROOT/../local-agent-meter/agent-meter.py\""
JOB_DIR="$ROOT/../local-agent-meter"
JOB_PROMPT=""
JOB_MODEL=""
JOB_CLAUDE_ARGS=""
